{"id":"n81350-1-8","stage":1,"title":"콧물 · 鼻涕","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81350-1-8-1","ko":"매운 국물을 마셔서 그런지 콧물이 자꾸 나오네.","zh":"可能是喝了太辣的汤，鼻涕一直流个不停啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매운","meaning":"辣","explanation":"맵다：辣；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맵다","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74131","senseId":"1","lemma":"맵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매운","audio":"/audio/e008a63b3263410b6f35.mp3"}},{"text":"국물을","meaning":"汤水，汤汁","explanation":"국물：汤水，汤汁；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"국물","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64512","senseId":"1","lemma":"국물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국물을","audio":"/audio/5de044307c680d0422ea.mp3"}},{"text":"마셔서","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마셔서","audio":"/audio/673b69690c6646b8e013.mp3"}},{"text":"그런지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런지","audio":"/audio/704d00595d8d6a229772.mp3"}},{"text":"콧물이","meaning":"鼻涕，鼻水","explanation":"콧물：鼻涕，鼻水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"콧물","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81350","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콧물이","audio":"/audio/5b5327f66113e5b79f92.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"나오네.","meaning":"流出，漏出，涌出","explanation":"나오다：流出，漏出，涌出；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"9","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오네","audio":"/audio/748c0c58eb06e4bfb20d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"13d9c3d2d64fee08","term":"맵다","zh":"辣","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3","entryId":"74131","definition":"像辣椒或芥末等那样味道有刺激性，舌尖有刺痛感。","pronunciation":["맵따"]},{"id":"28fc4f685e87f9f4","term":"국물","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3","entryId":"64512","definition":"在清汤或浓汤等食物里，除去汤料以外剩下的水。","pronunciation":["궁물"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"8ba5845818eda881","term":"콧물","zh":"鼻涕，鼻水","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3","entryId":"81350","definition":"从鼻孔里流出来的粘粘糊糊的液体。","pronunciation":["콘물"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"流出，漏出，涌出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"液体或气体等从里面流到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d4fbfd27f6996a558c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81350-1-8-2","ko":"휴지 갖다 줄게. 콧물 닦아.","zh":"我拿纸巾给你，擦擦鼻涕吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴지","meaning":"卫生纸，手纸","explanation":"휴지：卫生纸，手纸","readings":[{"term":"휴지","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44797","senseId":"2","lemma":"휴지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴지","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3"}},{"text":"갖다","meaning":"用，拿","explanation":"갖다：用，拿；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29738","senseId":"13","lemma":"갖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄게","audio":"/audio/f81c77e211e7de437a74.mp3"}},{"text":"콧물","meaning":"鼻涕，鼻水","explanation":"콧물：鼻涕，鼻水","readings":[{"term":"콧물","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81350","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콧물","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3"}},{"text":"닦아.","meaning":"擦，拭","explanation":"닦다：擦，拭；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"닦다","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60316","senseId":"1","lemma":"닦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닦아","audio":"/audio/3ff71fa0c7c5de7be766.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d0ab2df41b75912","term":"휴지","zh":"卫生纸，手纸","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3","entryId":"44797","definition":"用来擦脏东西的薄纸。","pronunciation":["휴지"]},{"id":"48e4cf165dc4c1c6","term":"갖다","zh":"用，拿","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3","entryId":"29738","definition":"把某物作为工具或材料、手段或方法。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"8ba5845818eda881","term":"콧물","zh":"鼻涕，鼻水","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3","entryId":"81350","definition":"从鼻孔里流出来的粘粘糊糊的液体。","pronunciation":["콘물"]},{"id":"ba0c254ce311d46f","term":"닦다","zh":"擦，拭","audio":"/audio/ba0c254ce311d46f6118.mp3","entryId":"60316","definition":"为去掉脏东西而抹。","pronunciation":["닥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e253a7392a4ebddcfbc6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81350","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1791,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我拿纸巾给你，擦擦鼻涕吧。","可能是喝了太辣的汤，鼻涕一直流个不停啊。","伤得严重吗？医生怎么说？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["可能是喝了太辣的汤，鼻涕一直流个不停啊。","伤得严重吗？医生怎么说？","我拿纸巾给你，擦擦鼻涕吧。"],"answer":2}]}
